SUMMARY:The Mix and Mingle Saturday Night Dinner Party with 80s and 90s Mu
 sic! 
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nGood day everyone\,\n\n**Great foo
 d\, great conversation and some of the best music from the 80s and 90s —
  a fun way to spend your Saturday night!**\nJoin us for a relaxed and frie
 ndly Saturday night dinner party where you can meet new people\, catch up 
 with familiar faces and enjoy an evening of conversation\, laughter and cl
 assic 80s and 90s music.\n\n\\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so w
 e can anticipate a fabulous turn out with lots of friendly peers to begin 
 our weekend with!\n\n\\*Please note we are at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub
 ** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence - south of the 
 401 **(we are in the back dining area to find us)**\n\n*\\*You can also as
 k the wait staff or bartender if you like to show you to the group (simply
  ask for Steve's games event)*\n\n**-Free Parking found on residential sid
 e streets**\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nDJ Steve Flemming\n
 (Organizer/Host )\n\nEvent Details:\n**The Mix and Mingle Saturday Night D
 inner Party!**\n\nCome on your own or bring a friend. We'll enjoy dinner t
 ogether\, mingle throughout the evening and let some great music from two 
 unforgettable decades add to the atmosphere.\n\n• **Mix and mingle** wit
 h a friendly group in a relaxed social setting\n• **Enjoy dinner and con
 versation** while getting to know some new people\n• **Listen to great 8
 0s and 90s music** throughout the evening\n• **Come on your own or bring
  a friend** — everyone is welcome to join the fun\n\n**Event Fee: $5**\n
 Payment can be made **in cash at the event** or **in advance by e-transfer
  to [SteveFlemming11@gmail.com](mailto:SteveFlemming11@gmail.com)**.\nIf p
 aying by e-transfer\, please include **your name** in the message so your 
 payment can be easily identified.\nCome hungry\, bring your sense of fun a
 nd join us for a Saturday night of food\, music and good company!\n\n**Fri
 endly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time after 6:30 for dinner and mingling\
 n\\*No extra fee for the 80s and 90s party after dinner\n\n\\*Great dinner
  menu and food specials provided:\n(One beverage or appetizer minimum upon
  arrival to support venue)\n\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of 
 street parking on avenue and free residential parking\nhttps://www.firkinp
 ubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/\n\n(15-20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence 
 subway station-or simply take bus or uber from the station)
